Subject: [PATCH] Skip NativePresets subdir on Windows


diff --git a/src/Makefile.in b/src/Makefile.in
index 26ceca6..b4c57b7 100644
--- a/src/Makefile.in
+++ b/src/Makefile.in
@@ -161,2 +161,2 @@
